/T (INTRODUCTION About Us. About the Company Tesco Structure LLP is a trusted construction company with over 15 years of experience in delivering high-quality projects for industrial, commercial, and residential clients. We specialize in Pre-Engineered Buildings \(PEB\), structural steel solutions, roofing systems, multi-storey construction, civil works, and architectural and structural consultancy. Our team focuses on strong design, quality materials, modern construction methods, and timely project completion. We are committed to building safe, durable, and cost-effective structures while maintaining long-term relationships with our clients through reliability and professional service.)
/E (INTRODUCTION About Us. About the Company Tesco Structure LLP is a trusted construction company with over 15 years of experience in delivering high-quality projects for industrial, commercial, and residential clients. We specialize in Pre-Engineered Buildings \(PEB\), structural steel solutions, roofing systems, multi-storey construction, civil works, and architectural and structural consultancy. Our team focuses on strong design, quality materials, modern construction methods, and timely project completion. We are committed to building safe, durable, and cost-effective structures while maintaining long-term relationships with our clients through reliability and professional service.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
